T* /F1 11 Tf (EXECUTIVE SUMMARY:) Tj T* /F1 10 Tf
(SplatCat is a commercial-grade 3D Gaussian Splatting application ecosystem for macOS and iOS.) Tj T*
(To guarantee full commercial distribution and resale compliance, all third-party repositories) Tj T*
(used operate exclusively under permissive open-source licenses \(Apache-2.0, MIT, BSD-3-Clause\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
