() Tj T*
(1. GLOMAP \(BSD-3-Clause\) - github.com/colmap/glomap) Tj T*
(   Global Structure-from-Motion \(SfM\) camera pose solver \(crates/engine/src/sfm_glomap.rs\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. COLMAP \(BSD-3-Clause\) - github.com/colmap/colmap) Tj T*
(   Sparse feature extraction, camera calibration, and point cloud data model reference.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
