(   Differentiable 3DGS rasterization engine running on Apple Silicon Metal via Rust \(wgpu\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. gsplat \(Apache-2.0\) - github.com/nerfstudio-project/gsplat) Tj T*
(   Mathematical reference for 3D Gaussian rasterization & spherical harmonics.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Nerfstudio \(Apache-2.0\) - github.com/nerfstudio-project/nerfstudio) Tj T*
(   Pipeline architecture reference for splat pruning and density optimization.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
